WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.543 --> 00:00:04.421
Another beautiful Savannah morning
at Disney's

00:00:04.421 --> 00:00:07.924
Animal Kingdom theme park.

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:13.596
Like every day,

00:00:13.596 --> 00:00:16.391
the residents are hungry.

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:22.105
Basically, my job is one of the cooler
jobs we have here on the team.

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:24.357
I get to feed everybody today.

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:27.652
With over 100 animals
on the savannah, Rory

00:00:27.652 --> 00:00:30.155
and the rest of the care team
have their hands full.

00:00:32.323 --> 00:00:33.908
And got one of our Springbok.

00:00:33.908 --> 00:00:35.660
Do you want to come up too?

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:37.328
You're a good girl.

00:00:37.328 --> 00:00:40.540
Do you want some produce?

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:42.667
Hey, come here.

00:00:42.667 --> 00:00:45.545
Oh, you're such a good girl.

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:47.589
You're such a good girl.

00:00:47.589 --> 00:00:50.800
Each one out
here has a special place in Rory's heart.

00:00:50.925 --> 00:00:52.469
Hello, ladies.

00:00:52.927 --> 00:00:54.554
Oh, you're all right.

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:57.098
Are you good girl.

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:02.520
But there's one savanna species
he really dotes on.

00:01:02.812 --> 00:01:05.815
Let's see what the giraffe are up to.

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:09.611
I have been training giraffe now

00:01:09.611 --> 00:01:12.989
for about six years,
and I've been trained by some giraffe.

00:01:13.615 --> 00:01:18.036
Not too long ago,
Rory worked with his giraffe, BFF Kenya,

00:01:18.536 --> 00:01:21.498
to voluntarily position herself
for a golf trip.

00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:23.833
Oh, that's a good girl.

00:01:23.833 --> 00:01:26.211
Come on, baby. Be here a while.

00:01:26.211 --> 00:01:29.255
Kenya tested the team's patience
for eight months.

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:32.467
Progress was slow.

00:01:33.718 --> 00:01:35.428
Good afternoon, Kenya.

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:38.223
Let's rock and roll.

00:01:39.849 --> 00:01:42.769
Show your stuff, honey.

00:01:44.187 --> 00:01:46.606
There you go.

00:01:47.232 --> 00:01:49.484
Yes, that was awesome.

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:55.323
I'd say I'm psyched.

00:01:56.407 --> 00:01:59.828
So we're really lucky here
to be a part of the Maasai

00:01:59.828 --> 00:02:03.248
giraffe species survival plan.

00:02:03.248 --> 00:02:03.665
Giraffe?

00:02:03.665 --> 00:02:06.042
We're actually undergoing
something called a silent extinction.

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:10.213
The last 40 or so years,
a large percentage of their wild

00:02:10.213 --> 00:02:14.717
population has decreased,
and not a lot of people are aware of that.

00:02:15.677 --> 00:02:16.344
We're helping

00:02:16.344 --> 00:02:19.597
people learn every truck
that's going through the safari,

00:02:19.597 --> 00:02:22.267
the driver is trying to teach them
about conservation.

00:02:23.351 --> 00:02:25.728
You know,
if you can have one person on one truck,

00:02:26.271 --> 00:02:29.482
if you're talking about all the trucks
that are going through every day.

00:02:29.649 --> 00:02:33.194
If those people can go home and talk to
somebody, it's a conservation win.

00:02:41.161 --> 00:02:43.454
I got to go back to work.

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:47.458
So we actually have from left to right,
we've got Lara

00:02:47.917 --> 00:02:52.422
Humphrey, Lily, Jabari, Maple and Iola

00:02:52.755 --> 00:02:56.801
and then Kenya's all the way in the back
and Willow is all the way over there.

00:02:56.801 --> 00:02:58.845
You can actually barely see her.
She looks like a tree.

00:02:59.137 --> 00:03:02.807
She's a great example of their camouflage.

00:03:03.308 --> 00:03:06.186
They look pretty different,
at least to me.

00:03:06.895 --> 00:03:11.482
If you say so, Rory.

00:03:11.482 --> 00:03:14.777
Step one When feeding the supermodels
of the savannah

00:03:14.777 --> 00:03:18.239
runway, entice them with something tasty.

00:03:19.782 --> 00:03:20.742
Every day, our animal

00:03:20.742 --> 00:03:24.162
nutrition center delivers a thousand pounds of brows.

00:03:25.246 --> 00:03:27.582
Today we've got Acacia.

00:03:27.582 --> 00:03:30.668
And then this is what some of our giraffes
really, really love.

00:03:30.668 --> 00:03:33.087
And we'll mix it up with the acacia.

00:03:33.087 --> 00:03:36.674
So this is Ilio carcass or Japanese
blueberry?

00:03:37.675 --> 00:03:41.012
Browse is great for us because not only
are they eating the leaves,

00:03:41.221 --> 00:03:42.430
but they're eating sticks

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:45.308
that are green like this,
and then they're also stripping the bark.

00:03:45.725 --> 00:03:48.770
So it's really important
for their dental hygiene

00:03:48.895 --> 00:03:52.190
and also just their natural stimuli
of their brain.

00:03:53.149 --> 00:03:54.734
So I made up that bundle.

00:03:54.734 --> 00:03:57.320
I had it in the back of the truck
and I'm ready to hang it.

00:03:58.613 --> 00:04:00.615
That's all it takes

00:04:04.077 --> 00:04:05.536
when they're moving their mouth like this.

00:04:05.536 --> 00:04:07.455
This is her chewing her cud.

00:04:07.455 --> 00:04:10.208
This is her digestive system
doing its job.

00:04:11.125 --> 00:04:15.755
When I see a giraffe chewing its cut,
I am seeing a happy giraffe.

00:04:16.881 --> 00:04:19.592
Giraffe have a really interesting
digestive system.

00:04:19.592 --> 00:04:21.261
They're ruminants.

00:04:21.761 --> 00:04:25.056
They need to keep their stomach going.

00:04:25.056 --> 00:04:29.143
So we need to offer them
food at all times.

00:04:29.227 --> 00:04:32.146
But Kenya, Mara and the rest of the herd

00:04:32.438 --> 00:04:35.108
can't rely on appetizers alone,

00:04:35.108 --> 00:04:39.195
so the team offers an all day buffet
with everything they need.

00:04:39.988 --> 00:04:41.322
We just hang some brows.

00:04:41.322 --> 00:04:44.742
We try to, throughout the day,
feed them their palate diet,

00:04:45.034 --> 00:04:47.954
which is their primary source
of all their nutrition.

00:04:48.246 --> 00:04:52.917
And we have these
hanging beans in the trees.

00:04:55.003 --> 00:04:56.087
All right.

00:04:56.170 --> 00:05:00.383
We'll give her a little
extra goodies in there.

